# Kernel config fragment for the Galaxy Tab S7 LTE (SM-T875, gts7l), merged onto mainline
# v7.3's arm64 defconfig by tools/gts7l-kernel.sh (merge_config.sh + olddefconfig; the
# script fails when a value here does not survive).
#
# 1. gts7xl-mainline's Android kernel config (android/kernel/gts7xl-android_defconfig at
#    the commit named in README.md): its Linux config plus AOSP's android-base.config
#    (v/android-6.6) and LineageOS's mainline fragments, reduced to what differs from
#    arm64 defconfig. Merged onto defconfig it gives gts7xl's resolved config exactly
#    (checked with scripts/diffconfig), except LOCALVERSION and CMDLINE, which are ours
#    (section 3).
